<title>GERMANY: Helaba 1996 oper profit after provs up.</title>
<headline>Helaba 1996 oper profit after provs up.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group oper profit after provisions    384    up 20.8 pct</p>
<p>    Group net profit			    141    up 22.6 pct</p>
<p>    Dividend					5 pct  vs 5 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German bank is Landesbank Hessen-Thueringen Girozentrale AG. Partial operating profit comprises net interest and commission income minus operating costs.</p>
</text>
